OL,7,     Fenthusiasts from around the world
OL,8,     Ftune in to electromagnetic waves
OL,9,     Fthat fill the universe, radiating
OL,10,     Ffrom solar storms and bursts of
OL,11,     Flightning.
OL,12,G1600 The Power of Guilt
